The second is bounded by \(z_a\langle D\rangle_\psi/C\). The claimed \(O(C^{-1/2}\sqrt{\langle D+I\rangle})\) amplitude estimate follows. The same finite-sum argument covers the stipulated coherent edge sum without normalizing it or introducing coherence across distinct edges. The all-channel intensity form estimate follows from boundedness of these maps.

